---
import IconShield from './icons/IconShield.astro';
import IconArrowRight from './icons/IconArrowRight.astro';
---

<section id="contacto" class="py-24 px-4 relative">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-neutral-900 via-neutral-900/90 to-black border border-white/10 p-8 sm:p-14 relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
      <!-- Glow rojo en la esquina superior -->
      <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-80 h-80 bg-red-600/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center relative z-10">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-red-500">Contactá a Solius Studio</span>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
            Empecemos a construir <br />
            tu ventaja competitiva.
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            Te asesoramos de forma personalizada. Analizamos tu rubro y te mostramos cómo una web moderna o un flujo de automatización con IA puede ahorrarte horas y aumentar tus clientes.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-xs text-neutral-300">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <IconShield class="w-4 h-4 text-white" />
              <span>Presupuesto claro y cerrado, sin costos ocultos.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <IconShield class="w-4 h-4 text-white" />
              <span>Garantía de rendimiento y optimización en móviles.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Formulario o Acción Rápida -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-neutral-950/80 border border-white/10 p-6 shadow-inner">
          <form class="space-y-4" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();">
            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-neutral-300 mb-1.5">Tu Nombre o Empresa</label>
              <input 
                type="text" 
                placeholder="Ej. Estudio Legal Rossi / Café Bistro" 
                class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-neutral-900 border border-white/10 text-white placeholder-neutral-500 text-xs focus:outline-none focus:border-red-500 transition-colors"
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-neutral-300 mb-1.5">Rubro / Tipo de Negocio</label>
              <select class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-neutral-900 border border-white/10 text-neutral-300 text-xs focus:outline-none focus:border-red-500 transition-colors">
                <option value="comercio">Comercio Local / Gastronomía</option>
                <option value="juridico">Estudio Jurídico / Contable / Profesional</option>
                <option value="ecommerce">Tienda Online / E-commerce</option>
                <option value="ia">Automatización de Procesos con IA</option>
                <option value="otro">Otro Proyecto</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-neutral-300 mb-1.5">Teléfono o WhatsApp de Contacto</label>
              <input 
                type="tel" 
                placeholder="+54 9 11 ..." 
                class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-neutral-900 border border-white/10 text-white placeholder-neutral-500 text-xs focus:outline-none focus:border-red-500 transition-colors"
              />
            </div>

            <button 
              type="submit" 
              class="w-full mt-2 py-3 px-4 rounded-xl bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-500 text-white text-xs font-bold tracking-wide transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_0_20px_-3px_rgba(239,68,68,0.5)] flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group"
            >
              <span>Solicitar Diagnóstico Sin Costo</span>
              <IconArrowRight class="w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" />
            </button>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-neutral-500 text-center mt-2">
              Respondemos habitualmente en menos de 2 horas hábiles.
            </p>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
